
This is a version of OHDSI sourced scripts to build tables for CDM and 
to load vocab files.

This version puts it all into one database (see other folder structure for
version that splits the vocab into a separate database)

These files are (I believe) taken from 
https://github.com/OHDSI/CommonDataModel/tree/main/inst/ddl/5.4/sql_server
can't remeber where got the vocab_load.sql from - there are various hints that this
is no longer so obviously centrally distribued for some reason to do with which team 
is responsible for it
(https://github.com/OHDSI/CommonDataModel/issues/487)

The original parameterised files have been modified to put in explicit paths and schema names

These files are intended for use directly from SSMS